<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>CKD, Mental Health &amp; Sleep – W. G. M. Rivero, MD</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--navy:#0f1e2e;--gold:#b8962e;--gold-light:#d4af4f;--teal:#1a6b72;--teal-light:#e1f5f0;--text:#1a1a1a;--text-muted:#5a6472;--border:#e2e6eb;--bg:#f9fafb;--white:#ffffff;--red:#c0392b;--red-soft:#fdf0ef;--amber:#f5a623;--amber-soft:#fef9ec;--green:#2d7a4f;--green-soft:#edf7f2;--purple:#6b3fa0;--purple-soft:#f3eeff;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--white);line-height:1.7;font-size:16px;}
  .site-header{background:var(--navy);padding:0 32px;height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:200;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);}
  .site-header a.brand{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:white;text-decoration:none;}
  .site-header a.brand strong{font-weight:600;color:#d4af4f;}
  .site-header a.back{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:.04em;}
  .hero{background:var(--navy);color:white;padding:72px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-80px;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(184,150,46,.15);}
  .container{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  .hero-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(184,150,46,.4);padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .hero h1{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  .hero-sub{font-size:18px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);max-width:600px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:36px;}
  .hero-meta{display:flex;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);}
  .hero-meta strong{color:rgba(255,255,255,.9);font-weight:500;}
  .nav-strip{background:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:56px;z-index:100;}
  .nav-pills{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:12px 32px;max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;}
  .nav-pills::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  .nav-pill{white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:all .2s;}
  .nav-pill:hover{color:var(--navy);border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg);}
  .section{padding:64px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .section:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;}
  .section-tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .section h2{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3.5vw,32px);font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .section h3{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px;}
  .section p{color:#2c3340;margin-bottom:16px;}
  .section p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .intro-callout{background:#0f1e2e;color:white;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 36px;margin-bottom:36px;}
  .intro-callout p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.92) !important;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0;}
  .intro-callout p strong{color:#ffffff !important;}
  .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin:24px 0;}
  .three-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:24px 0;}
  .four-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:16px;margin:24px 0;}
  @media(max-width:600px){.two-col,.three-col,.four-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .feature-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;}
  .feature-card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0f1e2e;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .feature-card p{font-size:14px;color:#2c3340;margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;}
  .dot-teal{background:var(--teal);}.dot-red{background:var(--red);}.dot-amber{background:var(--amber);}.dot-green{background:var(--green);}.dot-navy{background:var(--navy);}.dot-purple{background:var(--purple);}
  .alert{border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin:24px 0;display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .alert-red{background:var(--red-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--red);}
  .alert-amber{background:var(--amber-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--amber);}
  .alert-green{background:var(--green-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--green);}
  .alert-teal{background:var(--teal-light);border-left:3px solid var(--teal);}
  .alert-purple{background:var(--purple-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--purple);}
  .alert-icon{font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
  .alert-body h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0f1e2e;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .alert-body p{font-size:14px;color:#2c3340;margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
  .alert-body ul{font-size:14px;color:#2c3340;margin:6px 0 0 16px;}
  .alert-body ul li{margin-bottom:4px;line-height:1.5;}
  .lab-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;}
  .lab-table th{text-align:left;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);padding:10px 14px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .lab-table td{padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:#2c3340;vertical-align:top;}
  .lab-table td:first-child{font-weight:600;color:#0f1e2e;}
  .lab-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  .lab-table tr:hover td{background:var(--bg);}
  .target-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--green-soft);color:var(--green);}
  .caution-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--amber-soft);color:#7a4a00;}
  .avoid-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--red-soft);color:var(--red);}
  .steps{margin:24px 0;}
  .step{display:flex;gap:20px;margin-bottom:24px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .step-num{width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--navy);color:white;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;flex-shrink:0;}
  .step-body{flex:1;}
  .step-body h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#0f1e2e;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .step-body p{font-size:14px;color:#2c3340;margin:0;}
  .num-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:24px 0;}
  .num-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;text-align:center;}
  .num-card .n-val{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);line-height:1;}
  .num-card .n-label{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.4;}
  .num-card .n-target{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green);margin-top:6px;}
  .sleep-block{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f1e2e 0%,#1a3a50 100%);color:white;border-radius:16px;padding:32px 36px;margin:24px 0;}
  .sleep-block h3{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);margin-bottom:16px;margin-top:0;}
  .sleep-block p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .sleep-block ul{color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:14px;margin-left:18px;}
  .sleep-block ul li{margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.55;}
  .checklist{background:var(--navy);border-radius:16px;padding:28px 32px;margin:24px 0;}
  .checklist h4{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:var(--gold-light);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .checklist ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  .checklist ul li{color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);font-size:14px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.5;}
  .checklist ul li:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .checklist ul li::before{content:'';width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(184,150,46,.25);border:1px solid rgba(184,150,46,.4);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
  .dr-card{background:#0f1e2e;color:white;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:48px;}
  .dr-card h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff !important;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .dr-card p{font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88) !important;line-height:1.6;}
  .dr-card .dr-creds{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55) !important;margin-top:8px;}
  .guide-footer{background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:40px 0;margin-top:64px;}
  .guide-footer .footer-inner{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}
  .guide-footer p{font-size:13px;color:#4a5260;}
  .guide-footer a{color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;}
  .disclaimer{background:var(--amber-soft);border:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.25);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;margin:40px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#2c3340;line-height:1.6;}
  .disclaimer strong{color:var(--navy);}

  /* ── DARK MODE ── */
  html[data-theme="dark"]{--navy:#0f1e2e;--gold:#b8962e;--gold-light:#d4af4f;--teal:#25949d;--teal-light:#0e2f32;--text:#e8eaf0;--text-muted:#8a95a8;--border:#2a3548;--bg:#141c2a;--white:#1a2030;--red:#e55050;--red-soft:#2a1515;--amber:#f5a623;--amber-soft:#2a1f0a;--green:#3d9a6a;--green-soft:#0e2a1c;--purple:#9a6ed4;--purple-soft:#1a1030;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] body{background:#0f1520;color:#e8eaf0;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .site-header{background:#080d16;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .nav-strip{background:#141c2a;border-color:#2a3548;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .hero{background:#080d16;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .section{border-color:#2a3548;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .intro-callout{background:#080d16;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card,html[data-theme="dark"] .num-card{background:#1a2535;border-color:#2a3548;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .section h2,html[data-theme="dark"] .section h3,html[data-theme="dark"] h4{color:#e8eaf0;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .section p,html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card p,html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-body p,html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-body ul li,html[data-theme="dark"] .step-body p,html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td,html[data-theme="dark"] .disclaimer{color:#c0cad8 !important;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card h4,html[data-theme="dark"] .step-body h4,html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-body h4{color:#e8eaf0 !important;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table th{background:#1a2535;color:#8a95a8;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td{border-color:#2a3548;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td:first-child{color:#e8eaf0;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table tr:hover td{background:#202d40;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .dr-card{background:#080d16;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .guide-footer{background:#141c2a;border-color:#2a3548;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-teal{background:#0e2f32;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-amber{background:#2a1f0a;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-green{background:#0e2a1c;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-red{background:#2a1515;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-purple{background:#1a1030;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .disclaimer{background:#2a1f0a;}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .sleep-block{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#080d16 0%,#0f1e2e 100%);}
  html[data-theme="dark"] .checklist{background:#080d16;}

  /* ── DESKTOP MODE ── */
  html[data-view="desktop"]{min-width:1024px;}
  html[data-view="desktop"] body{min-width:1024px;}

  /* ── TOGGLE BAR ── */
  .guide-toggle-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px 32px;background:rgba(10,18,32,0.96) !important;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08) !important;justify-content:flex-end;}
  .toggle-btn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;white-space:nowrap;}
  .toggle-btn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:white;}
  .toggle-btn.active{background:#b8962e;border-color:#b8962e;color:white;}
  .toggle-btn svg{width:12px;height:12px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .lang-label{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin-right:4px;letter-spacing:.06em;}
  .lang-btn{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);background:transparent;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}
  .lang-btn:hover{color:white;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);}
  .lang-btn.active{background:#b8962e;border-color:#b8962e;color:white;}
  [data-lang].lang-hidden{display:none !important;}

  /* ── PRINT ── */
  .print-btn{position:fixed;bottom:80px;right:24px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal);color:white;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;z-index:9998;}
  .print-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.1);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.35);}
  .print-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;}
  .print-btn .p-tip{position:absolute;right:54px;background:rgba(15,30,46,.9);color:white;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .15s;}
  .print-btn:hover .p-tip{opacity:1;}
  @media print{
    .site-header,.nav-strip,.guide-toggle-bar,.print-btn,.guide-footer{display:none !important;}
    body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#000;background:#fff;}
    .hero{background:#fff !important;color:#000 !important;padding:24px 0 16px !important;}
    .hero h1{color:#0f1e2e !important;font-size:22px !important;}
    .hero-sub{color:#444 !important;}
    .container{max-width:100%;padding:0 24px;}
    .section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;}
    .intro-callout,.sleep-block,.checklist{background:#f0f4f8 !important;color:#000 !important;border:1px solid #ccc;}
    .intro-callout p,.sleep-block p,.sleep-block ul li,.checklist ul li{color:#222 !important;}
    .feature-card{border:1px solid #ccc !important;background:#fff !important;page-break-inside:avoid;}
    .alert{border:1px solid #ccc !important;background:#f9f9f9 !important;}
    .dr-card{background:#f0f4f8 !important;color:#000 !important;border:1px solid #ccc;}
    .section h2,.section h3{color:#0f1e2e !important;}
    .lab-table th{background:#eee !important;color:#333 !important;}
    .lab-table td{color:#333 !important;}
    .disclaimer{background:#fff8e8 !important;border:1px solid #ccc !important;}
    @page{margin:18mm 15mm;size:A4;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="site-header">
  <a href="https://williamriveromd.com" class="brand">W. G. M. <strong>Rivero</strong>, MD</a>
  <a href="https://williamriveromd.com/guides/index.html" class="back">
    <span data-lang="en">← All Guides</span><span data-lang="tl" class="lang-hidden">← Lahat ng Gabay</span><span data-lang="ceb" class="lang-hidden">← Tanan nga Giya</span>
  </a>
</header>

<div class="guide-toggle-bar" style="justify-content:space-between;">
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
    <span class="lang-label">Language:</span>
    <button class="lang-btn active" id="glb-en" onclick="setLang('en')">English</button>
    <button class="lang-btn" id="glb-tl" onclick="setLang('tl')">Tagalog</button>
    <button class="lang-btn" id="glb-ceb" onclick="setLang('ceb')">Cebuano</button>
      <button id="glb-kap" class="lang-btn" onclick="setLang('kap')">KAP</button>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="darkToggle" onclick="toggleDark()" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;">
      <svg id="darkIcon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
      <span id="darkLabel">Dark</span>
    </button>
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="desktopToggle" onclick="toggleDesktop()" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;">
      <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
      <span id="desktopLabel">Desktop</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-tag">
      <span data-lang="en">Nephrology · Mental Health · Patient Guide</span>
      <span data-lang="tl" class="lang-hidden">Nefrolohiya · Kalusugang Pangisip · Gabay sa Pasyente</span>
      <span data-lang="ceb" class="lang-hidden">Nefrolohiya · Kalusugan sa Pangisip · Giya sa Pasyente</span>
    </div>
    <h1>
      <span data-lang="en">CKD, Mental Health &amp; Sleep</span>
      <span data-lang="tl" class="lang-hidden">CKD, Kalusugang Pangisip, at Tulog</span>
      <span data-lang="ceb" class="lang-hidden">CKD, Kalusugan sa Pangisip, ug Pagtulog</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">Why kidney disease affects how you think, feel, and sleep — and what you can do about it. Your mind and your kidneys are more connected than you know.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span><strong>Author:</strong> W. G. M. Rivero, MD, FPCP, DPSN</span>
      <span><strong>Specialty:</strong> Internal Medicine · Nephrology · Nutrition</span>
      <span><strong>Updated:</strong> 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="nav-strip">
  <div class="nav-pills">
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#connection">The Connection</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#depression">Depression</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#anxiety">Anxiety</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#cognitive">Brain Fog</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#sleep">Sleep &amp; CKD</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#rls">Restless Legs</a>
    <a class="nav-pill" href="#apnea">Sleep Apnea</a>
